Description: hugpy Station — desktop shell over the self-contained console backend.
 hugpy Station is a desktop shell over the self-contained console backend that
 manages the local machine's LXD. The install wires up the SUID chrome-sandbox,
 the /usr/bin/hugpy-station alternative, and (best-effort) adds the installing
 user to the lxd group so fleet VMs are visible on first launch.
